    "statement": "theorem qualified_BK_linear_certificate : (∀ (K : Type) [Field K] [Finite K] [DecidableEq K] (W : WeierstrassCurve.Affine K) (r : ℕ),r.Prime → r∣Nat.card W.Point → ∃ P : W.Point,P≠0 ∧ addOrderOf P=r ∧ r • P=0) ∧ (∀ (K : Type) [Field K] (A : M2 K) (q : K), q≠1 → A.det=q → ∀ v : Fin 2 → K, v≠0 → A*ᵥv=v → A.trace=1+q ∧ A.charpoly=(X-C 1)*(X-C q) ∧ ∀ k : ℕ,A^k=1 ↔ q^k=1) ∧ (∀ r : ℕ,r.Prime → (∀ k : ℕ,(1:ZMod r)^k=1 ∧ (jordan (1:ZMod r)^k=1 ↔ r∣k)) ∧ (jordan (1:ZMod r)).det=1 ∧ ((![1,0] : Fin 2 → ZMod r)≠0 ∧ jordan (1:ZMod r)*ᵥ ![1,0]= ![1,0]) ∧ ¬ (∀ k : ℕ,jordan (1:ZMod r)^k=1 ↔ (1:ZMod r)^k=1)) ∧ ¬ (∀ (K : Type) [Field K] (A : M2 K) (q : K), A.det=q → ∀ v : Fin 2 → K, v≠0 → A*ᵥv=v → ∀ k : ℕ,A^k=1 ↔ q^k=1)",
    "decl_sha256": "90b14f0e36dddcf0c5bd7a05fa8b905ec64cfb580f3c4490c875b884d1ce0712",
    "scope": "Actual finitefield Mathlib affinepointgroup finite via injective Option-coordinate encoding; every prime divisor of actual pointcardinality gives actual nonzero point of exact primeorder killedbyr via Cauchy. Independent generic arbitrary-field2x2matrix with actual nonzero fixedvector/detq/q!=1 has derived trace1+q/charpoly(X-1)(X-q) and A^k=I iffq^k=1forallk, by provedcoprime factors/CayleyHamilton. ActualJordanpowers overeverycommring/J(1)^k=J(k), allmoduliZModn identityiffn|k, everyprime nonzero fixedvector/det1/but1^k=1always anddirectnegation of deletingq!=1while retainingothermatrixhypotheses. No trace/diagonalization premise. Actual genericE[r]rank2/representation/Frobeniusdeterminant/descent and characteristic-rank bridge remainopen; actualpoint input and matrix theorem are explicit separate conjuncts. No identification of abstractJordan withactualF7Frobenius. OriginalqualifiedBKconfirmed atthese steps, notrefuted. No nativeexperiment/novelty.",
